    "title": "1 dead after crash on Hwy. 87 in San Jose - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Victoria Meza ,\n1 hours ago A person died following a solo-vehicle crash in a San Jose highway Wednesday night, the CHP said. CHP reports they responded to a crash northbound Highway 87, north of the 280 connector, at around 7:20 p.m. Authorities report a vehicle crashed into the center divide, and the person inside died... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
